ok - quiet checkpoint exits 124 with a clean checkpoint line and no live lock
ok - Perl fallback honors the cleanup bound before escalating an INT-ignoring direct watcher
ok - a checkpoint restores ignored INT before launching its watcher
ok - a checkpoint launches its watcher from a code root whose path holds a space
ok - a cancelled checkpoint forwards the cancel so its watcher releases the lock
not ok - the watcher outlived its group-killed checkpoint's 5-second cleanup grace
